{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN", "offset": 197, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0aff0aff7d1f0a6f0a7f8a8f247f1d72f2ff2c8f960f1bdf9c6f94af154f0cff0b881432f2ff59cf9d4f16ff0aff0eff7d18169f0c5f0d8f0ac816a", "baseline_text": "아아…사쿠라 씨와//함께 싸울 수 있다니，//꿈만 같아요…（발그레）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ……さくらさんと//一緒に戦えるなんて、//夢のようです……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 172, "unit": "dialogue:f0923a9a51ba23aa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN", "offset": 264, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0a58143f0a5f0b1f8c0f247f7d12f2ff1bef1f7f0a5f0bcf0f0f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "하，하나비 씨…//여전하시네요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "は、花火さん……//あいかわらずですね……", "pointer_offset": 176, "unit": "dialogue:097b7af328db89cb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN", "offset": 305, "capacity": 74, "raw_hex": "f148f0adfab5f0b1f18df0bcf0bef8e7f0a4f1d2f0a5f957f0faf0a3f1478143f0a6f0a7f8a8f247f8e1f371f8e1f0faf1d5f0e72f2ff35ff1adf0f4fb84f0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "야마토 나데시코를 지향하는 자로서，사쿠라 씨의 삶의 자세를//배우도록 하겠습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大和なでしこを目指す者として、//さくらさんの生きざま、//学ばせていただきます。", "pointer_offset": 180, "unit": "dialogue:4bb242c4878d826a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN", "offset": 384, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0a58143f0a5f0aff7d12f2ffa80f271f272f29ef0cef0b8f0cff1d481432f2ff360f184f944f1fbf0cff1c7f7d1", "baseline_text": "하，하아…//잘 모르겠습니다만，//참고가 된다면…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "は、はぁ……//よくわかりませんけど、//参考になるのでしたら……", "pointer_offset": 184, "unit": "dialogue:3144734eb05aa50d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03015.SBN", "offset": 447, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0f0f7d12f2ff167f183f0b5f8a4f0a5f0b1f0c08143f1def0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "네…//키타오지 하나비，갑니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい……//北大路花火、参ります！", "pointer_offset": 188, "unit": "dialogue:7c27be5533c20aec", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
